WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:04.800
You're so weird, Otis.

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:08.320
I'm not… I'm not normal.

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:09.920
Of course you're normal.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.840
You and your mum are freaks.

00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:15.840
I was just starting to feel
like a normal teenager

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:18.400
and now you go and make me
feel like a freak again!

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:21.040
You're doing it!

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:23.440
-Again!
-You used to care a lot.

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:26.960
Things are easier
when you don't care.

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:31.480
Maeve Wiley

00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:33.400
just likes playing
with people's feelings

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:35.240
and she doesn't really care
about anyone.

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:37.120
-What happened?
-You are so self-centred.

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:39.000
You don't care about anyone
but yourself!

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:45.360
I rang your mum
to pick me up

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:46.680
because this is
where I felt safe.

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:50.800
I think I made a mistake.

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:53.520
It's wrong, Otis.

00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:56.520
Well, I don't think it is.

00:00:56.600 --> 00:00:57.640
Are you ok?

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:02.960
He's being so weird.

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:05.440
Jonathan!

00:01:05.520 --> 00:01:06.760
How could you?

00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:11.520
No, I don't want
to talk about it.

00:01:12.120 --> 00:01:13.240
I'll mess you up.

00:01:14.520 --> 00:01:15.360
I'm scared.

00:01:17.160 --> 00:01:19.040
How could you possibly
help me?

00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:20.560
You did this.

00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:32.720
What have you done?

